    "behavior": "falls-back-to-run",
    "reason": "Per-file fallback is not a build error. When a file cannot fold, chant imports and runs it; other files in the same build may still fold. Both builds exit successfully and produce output, with the summary line `fold: N files folded, M ran` capturing the decision."
